      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → BytePlus → BytePlus settings**.\n2. Describe the video in **Prompt**.\n3. Press **Run**. A four-second 480p draft is saved under `video/byteplus`.\n4. If the draft looks right, select **Finish** and press Ctrl+B to turn it on, then press **Run** again. Only the finish runs; ComfyUI reuses the draft.\n\nModel: Seedance 2.5. Activate it on ModelArk's **Model activation** page."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
