      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Finish** is off when the workflow opens, because a finished video is billed as a 1080p video. Seedance 2.5 remakes the draft at 1080p with the same prompt, length, and shape; a draft can be finished only at 1080p.\n\n1080p video from Seedance 2.5 is 10-bit H.265. If your player shows nothing, open the file in VLC, mpv, or QuickTime Player."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
